{"title":"Embermaw","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Embermaw is a named <a href=\"#/monster/red-dragon\">Red Dragon</a> seen at level 60.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Embermaw</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2248, 490</li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"embermaw\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>What it can drop</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/43de68fe0b30861ac6a9.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/pyreheart-torso\"><b>Pyreheart</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Dragonhide Torso)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">Critical hits set the target and up to 4 other monsters within 1.5 tiles of it burning.</span></li>\n      <li><b>Gear every kill:</b> a piece from its tier, excellent or better, and a second piece 1 kill in 5.</li>\n      <li><b>Gold</b> worth about 5 ordinary kills.</li>\n      <li><b>Enchanted:</b> 1 kill in 100 enchants a piece (up to 9c, and only what its material can hold).</li>\n      <li><b>Elite:</b> a boss spawns elite 1 time in 100, and an elite makes its unique 5 times as likely.</li></ul>\n      <p class=\"muted\">From the game’s rules and its own guide. See <a href=\"#/guide/unique-items\">Unique items</a>.</p>\n      <h2>Drops players have recorded</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragon-hide\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9e2b88dfaf721a2d79c9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragon Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-knick\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/620b30f073ef24409e0d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragon-fang\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2688ac9988cad641486e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragon Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bones\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c29e1ebe544dbfedca68.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bones</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-arms\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/01655d6cc28367cce40f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/bfbd66309f9f99fae2da.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Embermaw</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/red-dragon\">Red Dragon</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>60</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>1,365</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>58 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}